PLACEHOLDER — replace this file with the official, unmodified Apache License
2.0 text before publishing. Two ways to get it verbatim:

  1. GitHub: Add file -> Create new file -> type "LICENSE" -> "Choose a
     license template" -> Apache License 2.0. GitHub inserts the full text and
     fills in the year and owner.
  2. Download: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt

Do not retype or paraphrase the licence text. Then fill in the placeholders in
NOTICE, and apply the standard source header (below) to your own source files
if you want per-file attribution:

  Copyright [YEAR] [COPYRIGHT HOLDER]

